{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-core/src/content/mod.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:30:25.931134Z","id":"d9cbf4fadadc479e8c97d2d14e623d957861308516278267d73e4b9a08b29cdc","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"9983982150bdbba29a4cd231e43d749a8f060dbda2a3f1d104d4f88108d8ddd2","span":{"start":{"line":709},"end":{"line":724},"content_hash":"3c0de9a5ea114ce9cb4aa83114f5849753c98781f788a43bf61b3053f2e383c4"},"summary":"Since 5d7572d1 the server awaits async twins inline on its request task when the store is on one connection (Store::call_async, store/exec.rs:910), so a lock taken by a future on one tokio worker and resumed on another can now happen natively, but only on a store opened with Store::open_on on a multi-threaded runtime (tests: TestServer::spawn_on_one_connection, CLAX_TEST_SERVER_CONTENT=deferred). The daemon pool still drives every content job through Store::block_on on a store worker, where the holder thread is exact; a Durable Object has one thread.","supersedes":"cf5bea50d540fa512452c4bb5c986cf6240e277f4436045799563613fedd9cf9","tags":["session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-core/src/content/mod.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:31:11.895091Z","id":"b073803ce6d5ee61fc69b306c786f0222f16d411685f5c20be8aaf6c50073f52","body":{"kind":"resolve","summary":"Duplicate head left by a merge: this is a parallel branch's re-anchor of the record that 7971bec64cea64ab2c851301e44a9d6ef76cced0aec52a68d3531e9c97db08e2 closed (Fixed: remove_version is conditional on the tip. The contract (content/mod.rs Versions) removes only the newest version, and in git a remove is one atomic compa). That close stands in the merged code; this head carries no new content.","supersedes":"824a0e8e3986ee87d2788cedd346d8627d4ee14b6d3098c923a042ee2bfaa811","tags":["reason:duplicate","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
